{"id":"962a77c7991f2b4d","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Multiplication","display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Multiplication","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Multiplication","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Multiplication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))\">\\(R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))\\)</span> orders the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> successive copies of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)\\)</span> (canonical order-type predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\exists R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))\\;\\Bigl[\\forall\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi&#39;,\\eta&#39;\\rangle\\in\\beta\\times\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi&#39;,\\eta&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow \\xi&lt;\\xi&#39;\\lor(\\xi=\\xi&#39;\\land\\eta&lt;\\eta&#39;)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\exists R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))\\;\\Bigl[\\forall\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi&#39;,\\eta&#39;\\rangle\\in\\beta\\times\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi&#39;,\\eta&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow \\xi&lt;\\xi&#39;\\lor(\\xi=\\xi&#39;\\land\\eta&lt;\\eta&#39;)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The right factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> indexes successive copies of the left factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>, so the resulting order type is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\cdot\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\cdot\\beta\\)</span>. The canonical order-type predicate replaces an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalMultiplication}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\exists R\\subseteq((\\beta\\times\\alpha)\\times(\\beta\\times\\alpha))\\;\\Bigl[\\forall\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi',\\eta'\\rangle\\in\\beta\\times\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\xi,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle\\xi',\\eta'\\rangle\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow \\xi<\\xi'\\lor(\\xi=\\xi'\\land\\eta<\\eta')\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,\\beta\\times\\alpha,R)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\cdot\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false}],"bytes":1662,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2999","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-multiplication]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","5d2cd56a38a81b7a"]}